sdk_surface_examples:
JS SDK (pseudocode):
const sess = await Redwood.startStream({resume: null});
// stream emits: {type:'delta', text:'...'} or {type:'action_request', action_id:'a1', spec:{...}}
await sdk.atomicAction.start('a1');
// respond to action_request client-side then commit
await sdk.atomicAction.commit('a1', {result: {...}});
// on reconnect: const sess2 = await Redwood.startStream({resume: sess.resumable_id}); // server uses checkpoints to resume

Python SDK (pseudocode):
with client.stream(resume_token=None) as s:
  for frame in s:
    if frame['type']=='action_request':
      res = call_tool(frame['spec'])
      s.send({'type':'action_commit','action_id':frame['action_id'],'result':res})
